\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.5}{\ignorespaces Topological comparison of deep feature manifolds. The linear PCA projections (top) show overlapping global structures, while the non-linear UMAP manifolds (bottom) reveal well-separated, compact class clusters, justifying the use of non-linear RBF kernels.}}{12}{figure.caption.11}%
